o","t":122882.445275,"samples":3510,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129344.288959,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":133962.75441899998,"text":"বর্তমানের বেশিরভাগ গবেষণামূলক টেলিস্কোপই অনুকূল আবহাওয়াগত পরিস্থিতি সম্পন্ন দূরবর্তী অঞ্চলগুলিতে অবস্থিত বিশাল কেন্দ্রসমূহ।"},{"kind":"audio","t":134126.586532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":134131.55154999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":134137.041719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134142.565848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134147.503186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":134150.90826999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134151.308253,"samples":8191,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":135212.38901699998,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":138144.666784,"text":"মানুষরা হয়তো এটা আশা করে না যে ভ্রমণকারীদের জন্য ধৈর্য ও বোঝাপড়াও অপরিহার্য।"},{"kind":"audio","t":138243.039429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138248.205923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138253.76827099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138256.964628,"samples":20953,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":140524.58744099998,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":143181.900803,"text":"সুতরাং সম্ভবত এই চিহ্নটি শুধুমাত্র একটি লেবেল হিসেবেই যোগ করা হয়েছিল।"},{"kind":"audio","t":143277.310076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":143282.439352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143287.80318299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143291.03131999998,"samples":20674,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":147755.76084099998,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":150435.928505,"text":"কিন্তু পাখিদের ব্যাপারে অনেক বিষয় রয়েছে যা এখনও ডাইনোসরের মতোই দেখায়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":150529.24944299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":150534.20754099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":150539.484944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150542.011382,"samples":18167,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":154944.57559,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":159483.497755,"text":"সেগুলো প্রায় সবই বালুকাময় সমুদ্রসৈকত, যেখানে নিরাপদে সাঁতার কাটা যায় এবং বেশিরভাগ জায়গাতেই ছায়ার ব্যবস্থা রয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":159649.56375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159654.80980299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":159660.62189699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":159666.087027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159671.42231899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159674.804213,"samples":21176,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":159864.289261,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":160433.15099999998,"text":"পোহিকান গাছ।"},{"kind":"audio","t":160466.14259399998,"samples":27863,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":164332.848719,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":168955.368192,"text":"দুভাল, যিনি বিবাহিত এবং দুইজন প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক সন্তানের বাবা, মিলারের উপর খুব বেশি ছাপ ফেলতে পারেননি; গল্পটি তো মিলারকেই বলা হয়েছিল।"},{"kind":"audio","t":169105.629969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169110.67160499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":169116.23867299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":169121.819971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169127.187682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169129.83184899998,"samples":17554,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":169135.713401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169138.643513,"samples":19058,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"close","t":179205.705283,"code":1005}]}